{"ID":"20240506102411-ecq9xqz","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506102411-ecq9xqz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102411-ecq9xqz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102411-20z6qzv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613101855-41wj1ig\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1358,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613102152-d78rkp0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:9,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:9\u0026#125;","title":"293羊踯躅（闹羊花）","type":"doc","updated":"20240823152654"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240729085847-69i3fk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729085847-69i3fk1","updated":"20240729085847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产江苏、浙江、河南、江西等地。\n【性状】\t花多皱缩。花梗灰白色，长短不等。花萼5裂，边缘有较长的细毛。花冠钟状，长至3cm，5裂，顶端卷折，表面疏生短柔毛，灰黄色至黄褐色。雄蕊较花冠为长，弯曲，露出花冠外，花药棕黄色，2室，孔裂。商品不带子房，花等及花梗也常除去。气微，味微苦。\n【性味】\t辛，温，有毒。\n【功效】\t驱风，除湿，消肿，止痛。治风寒湿痹，跌打损伤，痔漏，癣疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240729085847-m1zd6o5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729085847-m1zd6o5","updated":"20240729085847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206112550-fnh4rdu.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240629163910-dpfy1ub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240629163910-dpfy1ub","updated":"20240629163910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 404px;","style":"width: 394px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"羊踯躅"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/羊踯躅-20240629163910-7y709ez.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 394px;\" parent-style=\"width: 404px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240629152401-2bxdkqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240629152401-2bxdkqf","updated":"20240823152648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 364px;","style":"width: 354px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"羊踯躅2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/羊踯躅2-20240629164003-szutyo7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 354px;\" parent-style=\"width: 364px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 345px;","style":"width: 335px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240629152401-yoyqe4e.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 335px;\" parent-style=\"width: 345px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 532px;","style":"width: 522px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240629164822-jbvql20.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 522px;\" parent-style=\"width: 532px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823151912-drfpjpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823151912-drfpjpl","updated":"20240823152649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 603px;","style":"width: 593px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"闹羊花 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/闹羊花 3-20240823151630-9219blq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 593px;\" parent-style=\"width: 603px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 637px;","style":"width: 627px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"闹羊花 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/闹羊花 6-20240823151946-zp7jn0x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 627px;\" parent-style=\"width: 637px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823151946-a8b92fg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823151946-a8b92fg","updated":"20240823152651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 345px;","style":"width: 335px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"闹羊花 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/闹羊花 7-20240823152010-fatur7j.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 335px;\" parent-style=\"width: 345px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 899px;","style":"width: 889px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"闹羊花"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/闹羊花-20240823151429-21qe2ic.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 889px;\" parent-style=\"width: 899px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823151904-7aqsjfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823151904-7aqsjfl","updated":"20240823152652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 556px;","style":"width: 546px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"闹羊花 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/闹羊花 9-20240823152420-j41vgow.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 546px;\" parent-style=\"width: 556px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 704px;","style":"width: 694px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"闹羊花 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/闹羊花 5-20240823151904-lkft7gh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 694px;\" parent-style=\"width: 704px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823152338-9es614c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823152338-9es614c","updated":"20240823152654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 732px;","style":"width: 722px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"闹羊花 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/闹羊花 4-20240823151727-mfoov0p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 722px;\" parent-style=\"width: 732px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 496px;","style":"width: 486px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"闹羊花 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/闹羊花 8-20240823152338-pmw5c7p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 486px;\" parent-style=\"width: 496px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240613101851-n61gsjh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101851-n61gsjh"}},{"ID":"20240613101959-oszxk2h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101959-oszxk2h","updated":"20240613102003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101959-retp6iw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101959-retp6iw","updated":"20240613101959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101959-gpb1ug3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101959-gpb1ug3","updated":"20240613101959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主贼风在皮肤中，淫淫痛，温疟。恶毒，诸痹。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101959-ovy81s7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101959-ovy81s7","updated":"20240613101959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：羊踯躅花，神农雷公辛有毒，生淮南，治贼风恶毒诸邪气（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101959-7m4p7fm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101959-7m4p7fm","updated":"20240613101959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名玉支，生太行山，及淮南山，三月采花，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101959-k9ouef6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101959-k9ouef6","updated":"20240613101959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《广雅》云：羊踯躅，英光也。古今注云：羊踯躅花，黄羊食之，则死，羊见之则踯躅分散，故名羊踯躅。陶宏景云：花苗似鹿葱。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102008-2wyfkyc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613102008-2wyfkyc"}},{"ID":"20240613102010-bkp4x2c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613102010-bkp4x2c","updated":"20240613102014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240613102010-xxs652b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102010-xxs652b","updated":"20240613102010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅，味辛，气温，有大毒。入脾经。主风湿藏肌肉之里，识识痹麻。治贼风在于皮肤之中，淫淫掣痛。鬼 蛊毒瘟疮恶毒，并能祛之。此物必须外邪难外越者，始可偶尔一用以出奇，断不可频用以眩异也。近人将此物炒黄为丸，以治折伤，亦建奇功。然只可用至三分，重伤者，断不可越出一钱之外耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102010-d7adyhz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102010-d7adyhz","updated":"20240613102010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问羊踯躅乃迷心之药，何以子取之而治病？嗟乎！无病之人，服羊踯躅则迷心；有病之人，服羊踯躅则去疾。此反用以出奇，胜于正用之平庸。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102101-vezd6v8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613102101-vezd6v8"}},{"ID":"20240613102102-0pmt8ys","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613102102-0pmt8ys","updated":"20240613102106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240613102102-i9wxqls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102102-i9wxqls","updated":"20240613102102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，气温。有大毒。向阳山谷，逢春则生。起苗一尺余高，结蕊二月半后。叶如桃叶深绿，花似瓜花正黄。羊误食之，踯躅而死。故《本经》竟名羊踯躅，今南人又呼黄杜鹃。依时采花，阴干入药。主风湿藏肌肉里， 痹麻；治贼风在皮肤中，淫淫掣痛。鬼疰蛊毒并治，瘟疟恶毒齐驱。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102132-us9gdr9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613102132-us9gdr9"}},{"ID":"20240613102134-oyf80u5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613102134-oyf80u5","updated":"20240613102142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613102134-84y6l1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102134-84y6l1m","updated":"20240613102134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味辛温，有大毒。主治贼风在皮肤中淫淫痛，温疟，恶毒，诸痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102134-zodni3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102134-zodni3f","updated":"20240613102134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（羊踯躅近道诸山皆有之，茎高三四尺，叶似桃叶，夏开花五出，蕊瓣皆黄色，羊食其花叶闹羊花。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613102134-hwhbqmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102134-hwhbqmb","updated":"20240613102134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅花色黄，气味辛温，禀火土金相生之化。羊乃火畜而兼土金，南方赤色，其畜羊，火在卦为兑，金也。此花大毒，亦禀火土金之化，羊食之，则同气相感而受其毒，是以踯躅而死。金主皮毛，土主肤肉，火主血脉，主治贼风在皮肤中淫淫痛，治随经内薄，治温疟恶毒，治火主之经脉也。诸痹乃皮脉肉之痹，而踯躅亦治之也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102134-a4w2g3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102134-a4w2g3a","updated":"20240613102134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（按∶闹羊花羊食之则死，缘此花有毒故也，谓同气相感而受毒，此说似属蛇足，不必参究至此。李时珍曰∶此物有大毒，曾有人以其根入酒饮，遂至于毙。《和剂局方》治中风瘫痪，伏虎丹中亦用之，不多服耳。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613102151-oq5vma9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613102151-oq5vma9"}},{"ID":"20240613102152-d78rkp0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613102152-d78rkp0","updated":"20240613102158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613102152-tpamefe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102152-tpamefe","updated":"20240613102155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"羊踯躅"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生太行山川谷及淮南山，今所在有之。春生苗，似鹿葱；叶似红花；茎高三、四尺；夏开花，似凌霄、山石榴、旋复辈，而正黄色；羊误食其叶，则踯躅而死，故以为名。三月、四月采花阴干。今岭南蜀道山谷遍生，皆深红色，如锦绣然。或云此种不入药。古大方多用踯躅，如胡洽治时行赤散，及治五嗽四满丸之类，及治风诸酒方，皆杂用之。又治百病风湿等，鲁王酒中亦用踯躅花。今医方捋脚汤中多用之。南方治蛊毒下血，有踯躅花散甚胜。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102121-0m1fxtv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613102121-0m1fxtv"}},{"ID":"20240613102122-xo1bk50","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613102122-xo1bk50","updated":"20240613102127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240613102122-yjkxyf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102122-yjkxyf6","updated":"20240613102122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，有大毒。主贼风在皮肤中淫淫痛，温疟恶毒，诸痹，邪气，鬼疰，蛊毒。一名玉支。生太行山川谷及淮南山，三月采花，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102111-7imljad","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613102111-7imljad"}},{"ID":"20240613102112-2tqiyky","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613102112-2tqiyky","updated":"20240613102117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240613102112-2a3eqkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102112-2a3eqkc","updated":"20240613102112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，有大毒。主贼风在皮肤中淫淫痛，温疟，恶毒，诸痹，邪气鬼疰，蛊毒性论》云∶恶∶诸石及面。又云∶今医方捋脚汤中多用之，南方治蛊毒下血，有踯躅胜。生∶太行山。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102033-d7dfos2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613102033-d7dfos2"}},{"ID":"20240613102034-n7gdd0q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613102034-n7gdd0q","updated":"20240613102039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240613102034-qqv4go1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102034-qqv4go1","updated":"20240613102034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。主贼风在皮肤中淫淫痛。温疟恶毒诸痹。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102034-83swfsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102034-83swfsj","updated":"20240613102034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玉枝春盎。遍野纷黄。猛方说虎。击独惊羊。瓜花五出。桃叶分张。映山锦绣。别照红妆。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102034-2bxlg5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102034-2bxlg5w","updated":"20240613102034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"名医曰。一名玉枝。三月采花。苏恭曰。似旋花色黄。李时珍曰。一名老虎花。一名惊羊。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102034-9cfe4i0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102034-9cfe4i0","updated":"20240613102034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"古今注。羊见之则踯躅分散。韩保升曰。花似瓜花五出。叶似桃叶。苏颂曰。岭南蜀道遍生。深红色。如锦绣然。李时珍曰。红者山躅。一名映山红。与此别类。江总诗。初日照红妆。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102044-hf4dlfs","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613102044-hf4dlfs"}},{"ID":"20240613102045-goncm8l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613102045-goncm8l","updated":"20240613102055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613102045-q2hgplo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102045-q2hgplo","updated":"20240613102045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，有大毒。性极发散，能却诸风寒湿，故善治恶痹，然非元气壮实，何能当此毒药，必同安胃和气血药用乃可，故曰“气血虚人息之”。不可近眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102045-joxaus2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102045-joxaus2","updated":"20240613102045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅，又名黄杜鹃。主风湿藏肌肉里， 痹麻，治贼风在皮肤中，淫淫掣痛，鬼疰虫毒并治，温疟恶毒齐驱。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101851-1vms1g5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101851-1vms1g5"}},{"ID":"20240613101951-guf1hsi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101951-guf1hsi","updated":"20240613101954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101951-bng2pc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101951-bng2pc0","updated":"20240613101951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅辛温大毒，皮肤痛痒贼风酷，疰疟安然痢痹消，善除蛊毒兼诸毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101951-nvqblpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101951-nvqblpb","updated":"20240613101951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊误食则踯躅而死。凡用不可近眼。恶诸石及面。治风，诸酒方用之，不入汤药。"}]},{"ID":"20240613102020-khw5e55","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613102020-khw5e55"}},{"ID":"20240613102022-qgsnt55","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613102022-qgsnt55","updated":"20240613102027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613102022-xpsc31s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102022-xpsc31s","updated":"20240613102022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有大毒．主治邪气，鬼疰，蛊毒．一名玉支．生太行山及淮南山．三月采花，阴干"}]},{"ID":"20240613102022-u1wuyc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613102022-u1wuyc2","updated":"20240613102022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶羊踯躅，味辛，温．主贼风在皮肤中淫淫痛，温疟恶毒诸痹．生川谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240613101851-4smtctk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101851-4smtctk"}},{"ID":"20240613101921-grzzhp5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101921-grzzhp5","updated":"20240613101927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101921-rmmsizb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101921-rmmsizb","updated":"20240613101921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，有大毒。主治贼风在皮肤中淫淫痛，温疟、恶毒，诸痹。邪气，鬼疰，蛊毒，一名玉支。生太行山谷及淮南山。三月采花，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101921-nyi8jex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101921-nyi8jex","updated":"20240613101921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今近道诸山皆有之。花黄似鹿葱，羊误食其叶，踯躅而死，故以为名。不可近眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101851-cveh8kt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101851-cveh8kt"}},{"ID":"20240613101907-txjew7i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101907-txjew7i","updated":"20240613101914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101907-al6wjjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101907-al6wjjm","updated":"20240613101907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，有大毒。主贼风在皮肤中淫淫痛，温疟，恶毒诸痹，邪气鬼疰蛊毒。一名玉支。生太行山川谷及淮南山。三月采花，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101907-5pqcht1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101907-5pqcht1","updated":"20240613101907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶近道诸山皆有之。花、苗似鹿葱，羊误食其叶，踯躅而死，故以为名。不可近眼。唐本注云∶玉支、踯躅一名。陶于栀子注云∶是踯躅子，名玉支非也。花亦不似鹿葱，正似旋 花，色黄者也。今注其苗树生高三、四尺，叶似桃叶，花似山石榴。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶树生高二尺，叶似桃叶，花黄似瓜花。三月、四月采花，日干。今所在有之。药性论云∶羊踯躅，恶诸石及面，不入汤服也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101907-mra4rn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101907-mra4rn4","updated":"20240613101907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶羊踯躅，生太行山川谷及淮南山，今所在有之。春生苗似鹿葱。叶似红花，茎三、四尺。夏开花似凌霄、山石榴、旋 辈，而正黄色，羊误食其叶，则踯躅而死，故以为名。三月、四月采花，阴干。今岭南、蜀道山谷遍生。皆深红色如锦绣。然或云此种不入药。古大方多用踯躅。如胡洽治时行赤散，及治五嗽四满丸之类，及治风诸酒方皆杂用之。又治百病风湿等，鲁王酒中亦用踯躅花。今医方挪脚汤中多用之。南方治蛊毒下血，有踯躅花散，甚胜。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101851-0m1f6fx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101851-0m1f6fx"}},{"ID":"20240613101853-os1hcaa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613101853-os1hcaa","updated":"20240613101900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羊踯躅《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613101853-x3a1rhc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101853-x3a1rhc","updated":"20240613101853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，有大毒。主贼风在皮肤中淫痛，温疟，恶毒，诸痹。邪气，鬼疰，蛊毒。一名玉支。生太行山谷及淮南山。三月采花，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101853-5c88cxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101853-5c88cxh","updated":"20240613101853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今近道诸山皆有之。花黄似鹿葱，羊误食其叶，踯躅而死，故以为名。不可近眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101853-mo3nel1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101853-mo3nel1","updated":"20240613101853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案于栀子注中云∶是踯躅，子名玉支，非也。花亦不似鹿葱，正似旋 花黄色也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613101854-kgr9j7d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613101854-kgr9j7d"}},{"ID":"20240613101855-41wj1ig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613101855-41wj1ig"}}]}